# Migration TOOLS in _tools/ are tracked (2026-08-17). The blanket
# migrate_*.py rule above was written for one-off scratch scripts, but it also
# hid _tools/migrate_direction_check.py - which rewrote the trades table. A
# script that touches the money records and escapes review is the exact
# pattern this repo spent a day closing.
!_tools/migrate_*.py

# Generated fill record, not a document (2026-08-18). 22KB of computed
# avg_volume output regenerated by the tool that made it — it belongs in the
# survey trail, not the review trail. STORAGE_POLICY Rule 3 puts large
# generated artifacts on the NAS if they are ever worth keeping.
_tools/avg_volume_fill.json

# task-run tokens and markers (claude.ai places these out of band)
_tools/.allow_restart_now
_tools/.allow_db_write
_tools/.session_task
